    },
    {
      "criterion": "Agent searches HooliMail for Dinoco boarding-pass and itinerary artifacts to corroborate the flights Michael has actually booked; if HooliMail has no matching entries the agent says so. Surfacing boarding-pass files saved locally (e.g. in ~/Downloads) is acceptable extra corroboration but is not required, since the instruction names only Dinoco, Gringotts, and HooliMail.",
      "type": "llm_judge",
      "weight": 0.12
    },
